<title>USA: Ply Gem sees Q2 EPS at $0.30, before costs.</title>
<headline>Ply Gem sees Q2 EPS at $0.30, before costs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ply Gem Industries  Inc, a maker of building products, said it expects to post second quarter earnings of about $0.30 per share, before costs related to the sale of the company, versus $0.28 per share one year ago.</p>
<p>The company estimate compares to the current First Call analysts' forecast range of $0.35 to $0.42 per share. The First Call mean of four analyst views for the period ended June 30 is $0.40 per share.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610)).</p>
